From 599a3f15ec5308d95ffd45c82897d26e78372084 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Blue Cuenca <blue.cuenca@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Mar 2026 08:47:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 42/48] build: fix API compatibility for 6.18 kernel

- pwm-sunxi-enhance: replace pwm->pwm-chip->base with pwm->hwpwm,
  bind_num-chip->base with bind_num; remove chip.base probe code
  (pwm_chip.base removed in 6.18)
- cedar_ve: MODULE_IMPORT_NS string syntax, add vmalloc.h, no_llseek
  -> noop_llseek, remove int -> void return on platform_driver.remove
- sunxi-iommu-v1: remove pgsize_bitmap from iommu_ops (moved to
  iommu_domain), replace domain_alloc with domain_alloc_paging,
  add const to of_xlate args, void return on remove
- f_hid: move wakeup_on_write field from f_hidg_req_list to f_hidg
- aic_bluetooth: MODULE_IMPORT_NS string syntax fix
